# Cryogenic Stasis can target your own creature, but not a noncreature artifact (CR 115.1a).
# Exactly {1}{U} taps Memnite and puts one stun counter on it (CR 701.26a, 122.1d), leaving
# Ornithopter alone. The controller draws exactly the Forest on top, not the opponent (CR 121.1).

